[0.000, "o", "  ╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  ║                                                               ║\r\n  ║   tdai-memory-mcp                                             ║\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  ║   3-session demo: auto-capture + cross-agent handoff          ║\r\n  ║                                                               ║\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  ║   Session 1: Claude Code  →  works, exits, Stop hook saves    ║\r\n  ║   Session 2: Devin        →  starts, hook injects, recalls    ║\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  ║   Session 3: Codex        →  starts, hook injects, recalls    ║\r\n  ║                                                               ║\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\n\r\n"]
[4.006, "o", "  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r\n  │                                                             │\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  │  SESSION 1                                                  │\r\n  │  Agent: Claude Code                                         │\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  │  Task:   Architecture review                                │\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  │                                                             │\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\n\r\n"]
[3.010, "o", "  User:\r\n    > We need to pick a database for the memory layer.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    > SQLite or Postgres? What do you think?\r\n\r\n"]
[4.010, "o", "  Claude Code:\r\n    I recommend SQLite with WAL mode.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    It is local-first, needs no server, and handles crash recovery.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    Postgres would require a running server — that defeats the purpose.\r\n\r\n"]
[5.009, "o", "  [Claude Code calls tdai-memory capture]\r\n\r\n"]
[2.239, "o", "  Captured: 01KZRQQ51C7ZGZ8SFWX79FE98G\r\n"]
[3.060, "o", "\r\n  User:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    > Good. Also, I hit a bug with FTS5 after the schema migration.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    > The search stopped returning results.\r\n\r\n"]
[5.008, "o", "  Claude Code:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    That is a known FTS5 issue. When the source table schema changes,\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    the external content table breaks. You need to rebuild it:\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "    INSERT INTO captures_fts(captures_fts) VALUES('rebuild');\r\n\r\n"]
[5.009, "o", "  [Claude Code calls tdai-memory capture]\r\n\r\n"]
[2.229, "o", "  Captured: 01KZRQQKZXB1W1P3DMB7V1X7TF\r\n"]
[3.048, "o", "\r\n  User:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    > Thanks. I am done for now. Exiting.\r\n\r\n"]
[3.004, "o", "  ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─ ─\r\n  Session 1 is closing.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  The Stop hook fires automatically on exit.\r\n"]
